# HyperFrames tool state: previews, check caches, snapshots, locks and
# video-state.json (which points at machine-local ~/.cache history blobs).
.hyperframes/

# Studio caches, regenerated on demand.
.thumbnails/
.waveform-cache/

# media-use staging library. The sound effects the film uses are copied into
# assets/sfx and their licences are recorded in CREDITS.md.
.media/

# Rendered videos. Re-render with `npm run render`; share the final MP4
# outside git so each re-render doesn't add megabytes to history.
renders/
